<%# app/views/home/about.html.erb %>
<div class="container mx-auto py-16 px-6">
  <style>
    .glowing-outline {
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px 2px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.5), 0 0 20px 4px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.5), 0 0 30px 6px rgba(0, 123, 255, 0.5);
    }
  </style>

  <!-- About Me Section -->
  <div class="flex items-center mb-8">
    <div class="flex-shrink-0">
      <%= image_tag 'aidan.JPEG', alt: 'Aidan', class:"w-48 h-48 rounded-full mr-8"%>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-2">About Me & Fathership</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-gray-700">Hi! I'm Aidan DeVaney, the developer and creator behind Fathership. 
        I'm a third year Computer Science major with a Technology Management minor at UC Davis.
        </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- About the Project Section -->
  <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg p-4 mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">About the Project</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700">First, thank you for checking out Fathership! 
      This is a passion project that I was inspired to develop to give kids and those who may not have had a father figure in their lives a chance to talk to one, anytime. 
      As an only child in a single parent household, I personally felt the need for this concept but was suprised to not find anything readily available. 
      <b>So, I decided to change that.</b><br><br>
      
      As a passion project, I've been developing this in my free time, learning as I go, covering all the costs associated with it. 
      If you'd like to generously support this project, please consider donating to my <a href="https://www.buymeacoffee.com/aidandev" class="text-yellow-600 hover:underline">Buy Me a Coffee</a> page.
      Thank you, and I hope you enjoy using Fathership as much as I enjoyed building it!</p>
      <p>

    <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-2 mt-4">Now for the nerdy stuff...</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-700">This is a web application full-stack developed by me using Ruby on Rails and Tailwinds CSS in my tech stack. 
      It's supported by PostgreSQL in AWS RDS and REDIS services on the backend, hosted on Heroku, and with OpenAI's ChatGPT API powering the AI you know and love. <p>
  </div>

  <!-- Hiring Manager Card -->
  <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg p-6 mb-12 glowing-outline">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Are you a Recruiter or Hiring Manager?</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Hi! Great to meet you, and I'm truly glad you're checking out my app. <b>I'm currently searching for a Summer 2025 intership position!</b> 
    If you're interested in learning more about my work or seeing the source code, I'd love to connect with you on:</p>
    <div class="flex items-center">
      <div class="flex-shrink-0">
        <%= image_tag 'waves.gif', alt: 'Business Image', class: 'w-12 h-12' %>
      </div>
      <div class="ml-4">
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900">LinkedIn: <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/aidan-devaney/" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline">Here</a></p>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900">Handshake: <a href="https://app.joinhandshake.com/profiles/40951729" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline">Here</a></p>
        <p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-4">Email: <a href="mailto:amdevaney@ucdavis.edu" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline">amdevaney@ucdavis.edu</a></p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Driving my love developing apps for problems I know I can solve is my passion for leading the intersection of technology and people.
      <b>I'd love to bring that passion and my skills to your team in both Project Management and Software Engineering roles.</b> 
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Contact for Website Info -->
  <div class="bg-white shadow-md rounded-lg p-6">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Website Inquiries</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-2">For any inquiries, typos, issues, or suggestions related to this website, please email me at:</p>
    <p class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900"><a href="mailto:heyfathership@gmail.com" class="text-blue-500 hover:underline">heyfathership@gmail.com</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
